<title>EGYPT: Egyptian all-share index at record high.</title>
<headline>Egyptian all-share index at record high.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian all-share index closed at a record high of 324.78 points on Monday, up slightly from 322.44 points at Sunday's close, the Capital Markets Authority (CMA) data showed.</p>
<p>Sunday's close was also a record high, the seventh in as many trading days.</p>
<p>--Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
